      "writtenOn": "2025-11-14T21:50:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This causes issues as well because `rewindForRenderStep` is resizing `fTextures` with the express purpose of truncating away any textures added during the step.\n\nBecause `endCombinedData` is getting a span of the data and not copying it out, we can\u0027t rewind until after the data is added into the TextureDataCache.",
